### Documentation Format
```markdown
# [Library Name] Documentation

## Overview
[Brief description and when to use]

## Key Patterns
[Common usage patterns with code examples]

## Gotchas
[Known issues and workarounds]

## HeadcountSync Usage
[Specific examples from our codebase]
```

---

**Remember**: This is an MVP. Ship fast, gather feedback, iterate. Focus on core functionality that helps engineering managers visualize and manage team allocations effectively.

**Context is King**: Every implementation must have comprehensive context. When in doubt, add more context rather than less. The PRP framework is your guide to one-pass implementation success.